    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c45890e2-aea4-4f64-8690-7d0eb66017a9-image.png\" style=\"width: 282px; height: 186px;\" /></p><p>Area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, since rotation will not change the magnitude.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
